	"system": {
		"description": "<h2>Bulk Goods</h2><p>Grown specifically to carry large and heavy objects, you can carry an additional 2 bulky items balanced on, or strapped to, your rear torso.</p><h2>Heavyweight</h2><p>Your carrying capacity is tripled.</p><h2>Motility</h2><p>Due to your additional limbs and their ratcheting functions your speed increases by 10ft and your jumping distance doubles, so long as you do not exceed half of your carrying capacity and are not holding more than three bulky items.</p>",
